	('26dae654-f9db-412a-be4a-6cda7824c064', '8ef5fa21-9801-4913-845e-98c4e1ac2ced', 'Seating Arrangement', 'Linear', 'Five friends Bhanu, Chitra, Eswar, Ishaan, Jaya sit in a row facing north. Eswar sits at the extreme left. Ishaan sits immediately to the right of Eswar. Jaya sits at the extreme right and Chitra sits immediately to the left of Jaya. Who sits in the middle?', 'Order from left: Eswar, Ishaan, Bhanu, Chitra, Jaya, so Bhanu is in the middle.', 'MEDIUM', 1, 0.25, 'PUBLISHED', '2026-11-04 06:09:33.588', '2026-11-04 06:09:33.588', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'MCQ'),
